    {
      "content": "The number of football players is still not given. If \\(f\\) students are football players, then the percentage is\n\n\\[\n\\frac{f}{30}\\times 100\\%.\n\\]\n\nSo, the percentage **cannot be determined** without knowing \\(f\\).\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: 25% of Mr. Roper's class are football players.",
