    {
      "content": "We are told that **20%** of Mr. Roper’s class are football players.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: the school records football players as a separate group from cheerleaders and band members.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The separate classification of football players does not change the given percentage.\n\n\\[\n20\\% \\text{ of } 30=\\frac{20}{100}\\times 30=6\n\\]\n\nThus, 6 students are football players, representing\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n\\]",
